A. Interbank list of allowed channel IDs:
    For interbank, only request with below channel Ids will be allowed to access the endpoints.

    CHANNEL_ID     :   SOURCE_SYSTEM_ID
    ------------       ----------------
    1. STK         :   EQUITEL_STK        
    2. APP         :   EQUITY_APP
    3. WEB         :   EQUITY_WEB
    4. USSD        :   EQUITY_USSD
    5. EAZAPP      :   EAZZY_APP
    6. EAZNET      :   EAZZY_NET
    7. EAZBIZ      :   EAZZY_BIZ
    8. EVA         :   CHATBOT_EVA        
    9. OTC         :   BRANCH
    10. OMNI       :   OMNI


B. Testing Steps

    Note: For this test, please use OTC and BRANCH for channelId and sourceSystemId respectively. We cannot generate signature for the other channels since
    we dont have their current private keys.

